ECC Universal Harness Installer

This project reuses and generalizes certified integration logic originally
developed for the Everything Claude Code (ECC) ecosystem and its OpenCode
integration program (ECC-OPENCODE-INTEGRATION-1 .. 6).

The institutional runtime authority remains the ECC repository
(https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC or the ECC distribution in use). This project
consumes the ECC Institutional Public API (dist/institutional) through the
universal bridge contract; it does not duplicate domain authorities.

No third-party code is incorporated without attribution. All adapters in this
repository are distributed with the installer and are allowlisted.
